WEBVTT

00:02:29.273 --> 00:02:31.519
sickles and axes

00:02:31.519 --> 00:02:36.207
that I covered up with a piece of towel.

00:02:36.207 --> 00:02:38.088
I would bring the branches home,

00:02:38.088 --> 00:02:40.077
riding buses and subways,

00:02:40.077 --> 00:02:43.466
barely holding them in my hands.

00:02:43.466 --> 00:02:47.342
And I did not bring the tools here to Long Beach.

00:02:47.342 --> 00:02:48.898
Airport security.

00:02:48.898 --> 00:02:50.978
(Laughter)

00:02:50.978 --> 00:02:54.697
In the privacy of my room, covered in sawdust,

00:02:54.697 --> 00:02:58.751
I would saw, trim and polish wood all night long

00:02:58.751 --> 00:03:01.218
until a bow took shape.